  "outstanding": [
    "STO-01–02 derive separated compact-type orthogonality using the one-position operator estimates and analytic invariance of the derivative closure. TEC-01 constructs a model at the terminal parameter before the comparison on the stopping type gives its occurrence. The scalar Casimir and the smoothness of compact-finite vectors used in IBO-02 come from the kernel realization (KRL-05)."
  ]
